![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcWxIIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--95e85194e12ab35e101562e80ee9bb868babae62/image.png)
*Pela primeira vez na região Nordeste!*
*For the first time in the Northeast region!*

**Português:** 
- É imprescíndivel ter lido o [Regulamento da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) antes desta competição;
- A taxa de inscrição terá um valor diferente dependendo de quando você se inscrever, para mais informações, favor consultar a guia [Valor da inscrição](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value);
- Havendo qualquer dúvida, favor contactar algum dos organizadores ou Delegados listados.

---

**English:** 
- It is mandatory that you have read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) before this competition;
- The registration fee will have a different value depending on when you register, to get more information about it, please check the [Registration Fee's Value](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value) tab;
- If you still have any doubts, please contact one of the listed organizers or Delegates.

Kui olete **vähemalt 12-aastane**, peate esitama ühe järgmisest kahest dokumendist:

1. Covid-19 vastase vaktsineerimise tõendi, kusjuures vaktsineerimiskuur peab olema lõpetatud;
2. Covid-19 läbipõdemise tõendi, kusjuures positiivne testitulemus peab olema saadud viimase kuue kuu jooksul;

Võistlejad/külalised, kes on **12-17 aasta vanused**, võivad selle asemel esitada negatiivse PCR testi tulemuse (mitte vanem kui 72 h) või negatiivse antigeeni kiirtesti tulemuse (mitte vanem kui 48 h), kusjuures testi peab olema läbi viinud meditsiinitöötaja - tulemus peab kajastuma Digiloos.

Võistluspaigas on maskikandmine **kohustuslik**.

---

If you are **at least 12 years old**, after arriving at the venue you must present one of the following:

1. Proof of vaccination against Covid-19. Vaccination has to be completed;
2. Proof that you have recovered from Covid-19. The positive test result must be newer than six months;

Alternatively, competitors/guests who are **12 to 17 years old** may present a negative result from either a PCR test (no older than 72h) or an antigen test (no older than 48h) (tests performed by a medical professional).

Wearing a mask at the competition venue is **mandatory**.

